The UI font glyphs are the 5x7 drawings from the gbamp3 player v0.9.8
(https://github.com/Xinon232/gbamp3, player/src/text.c), copied verbatim to
tools/gbamp3_small_font/small_font.c. tools/build_ui_font.py compiles them and
adds the ASCII characters gbamp3 leaves blank and the Spanish accented letters
in the same style.

